SPIKE: GraphQL Gateway Evaluation - Grafbase vs Hive Router


Key details

Description

Conduct comprehensive evaluation of Grafbase and Hive Router as GraphQL gateway solutions for the insurance domain.
Compare architecture, federation capabilities, performance, operational overhead, and strategic fit before committing to long-term implementation.

 
We're currently exploring Grafbase as our GraphQL gateway to federate insurance APIs (accounts, policies, funds). However, Hive Router (formerly The Guild's GraphQL Mesh) is a mature alternative with established adoption in enterprise environments.
This spike will objectively compare both solutions across multiple dimensions.

Scope
	• Compare Grafbase and Hive Router for federation, REST integration and schema composition
	• Evaluate developer experience, operational overhead and deployment model
	• Produce comparison matrix, risks and recommendation for gateway selection
